      "id": "claim_33fc6adcc90a436cbe0834ee6334bed8",
      "statement": "The Supermemory engine builds as a separate image from the agent's so its graph database and local embedding model stay out of the agent sandbox and a Supermemory version bump does not invalidate the agent image's layer cache.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile.supermemory#L1-L8",
